          "NSFC Excellent Young Scientists Fund (Overseas) — 国家自然科学基金优秀青年科学基金（海外）",
          "2020: MPM Best Presentation Nomination (International Molecular Parasitology Meeting)",
          "2020: UT Southwestern Pharmacology Postdoctoral Excellence in Research Award",
          "2024: Invited speaker at Xiangya School of Basic Medicine, Central South University"
